      "timing_source": null,
      "text": "This funding will help make urgent water quality improvements to Lake St. Clair, to the Great Lakes, and to freshwater bodies all across our country. I would also like to thank the former distinguished member of this body and the current Macomb County Public Works Commissioner, Candice Miller, for her partnership to make sure we protect Lake St. Clair. Thank you so much, and I yield back to Balancing My Health.",
